work_units.notes:
Apply the same metric/unit/direction and badge hierarchy rules as Home:
  - per-query values must keep units and timing precision clear;
  - heatmap meaning must be visible and high-contrast compatible;
  - trust and validation badges must not overpower timings;
  - missing, failed, no-run, and zero/sub-ms states must be distinct;
  - matrix/list/rank modes must have consistent labels and URL state.
